# Thornwick texture style

Read [TEXTURE_STYLE.md](../../TEXTURE_STYLE.md) before creating, revising, or reviewing art. Compare the result with the existing in-game references at 1× and the default 2× zoom. Use the actual footprint and preserve its anchor and fixed features through all camera rotations.
